# data/predictions.db is a SQLite database committed by CI (see the
# scan-email-*/grading-report-* workflows). Mark it binary so git never
# attempts a line-based diff or 3-way merge on it -- a genuine concurrent
# write conflict surfaces as a clean "unmergeable" conflict instead of a
# corrupted file, which the workflows' rebase step aborts on (git rebase
# --abort) rather than retrying blindly.
data/predictions.db binary
